2,"Päri Language (LKR) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/lkr/,Päri is a stable indigenous language of South Sudan. It belongs to the Nilo-Saharan language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Päri,Nilo-Saharan
